2. **Choices:** all came from your statement. Every surface uses the default revisit trigger ("the first merged change that adds source code or a dependency manifest"). No accountability matrix.
3. **Stack decision:** `.pipes/project/05-decisions/decision-001-tally-stack.md`, status `accepted`. It records that you declared the stack without comparing alternatives. The name "Tally" comes from `README.md`.
