   - wrong version bumps;
   - a "tests must pass before review" duty you never stated;
   - a "read counts" workflow you never declared;
   - a contradiction in the integrations section;
   - present-tense sentences that read as if the code exists;
   - a duty placed on the first code change that should have been a revisit.

